# Flow UI system

Full reference: `docs/ui-system/` (README, tokens, layers, cards, elements, recipes).

## Pick the component by role

- Modal content → `FlowFullscreenCard(visible, onDismiss, title, variant, height, tabs, footer) { body }`
- Confirm/info → `FlowConfirmCard` (never `AlertDialog`)
- Item metadata → `FlowMediaCard(model = XMediaCardAdapter.model(...))`, route `MediaAction.id`
- List/grid item → `FlowDisplayCard` in `FlowDisplayList` / `FlowDisplayGrid`
- Floating over content → `FlowFloatingCard` / `FlowFloatingChip` inside `FlowDock { Item(visible) { } }`
- Tabs → `FlowTabBar(tabs = listOf(FlowTab.text/icon/action(...)), level = Primary|Secondary)`
- Screen shell → `FlowScreen(kind, topDock, bottomDock, fab, snackbar) { docks -> }`
- Controls → `FlowToggleRow`, `FlowSliderRow`, `FlowTextField`, `FlowDropdownRow`, `FlowChoiceChips`,
  `FlowPrimaryButton`, `FlowSecondaryButton`, `FlowTextAction`, `FlowCircleButton`, `FlowFab`

## Forbidden in feature code

`AlertDialog`, `Dialog`, `ModalBottomSheet`, M3 `Card`, `Scaffold`, new tab-bar composables,
literal `dp`/alpha/`zIndex` values (use `FlowTokens` / `FlowLayer`), per-feature enter/exit
animations for cards (components own motion).

## Behavior

- Fullscreen cards stack in open order; keep a parent `visible` while its child is open. Back and
  scrim tap close only the top card. `dismissible = false` blocks both.
- Footer order: `FlowActionRow(start = { destructive/extra }) { Cancel; Confirm }`.
- Fullscreen card height always wraps content and scrolls on overflow.
- Body with a `LazyColumn`: `scrollable = false`, list gets `Modifier.weight(1f, fill = false)`.
- Dock items declared top to bottom; content pads by `FlowScreenPadding`.
- Tap a display card = primary action; long-press = media card.
- New media source = new pure-Kotlin adapter + unit test, not new `FlowMediaCard` params.

When adding a token or component, update `docs/ui-system/`.
History, rejected designs, open threads: `../flow-reader-chats/areas/ui-system.md`.
